## Hints for Future Agents
The post-commit hook automatically pushes master and can rebase it. Disable hooks per commit invocation to attach its note before an explicit push. Shipped Herdr mods and layouts are replaced at startup, so edit the custom clones instead. Herdr does not update clones after app upgrades. The installer deliberately accepts both the original and already-patched row expression, and fails if exactly one matching expression cannot be found. It skips sidebar setup when no app is running, while still installing keys and shortcut mods. Herdr's check warns that the cloned default mod calls hc; the check passed and the call comes from the bundled Spaces implementation. A layout switch creates fresh mod instances and can reset transient presentation state such as the folded Idle agents list.

## Codebase Discoveries
The desktop uses ~/.config/herdr-app and is independent of the TUI's config.toml. A renamed space is identified by w.named. Skipping gitTail for named spaces removes its repo, branch, and ahead/behind text from the sidebar without changing the bottom status bar. layout.clone preserves layout sizes and click adjustments. Generated dotfiles-spaces and dotfiles-main files live in the app home and are not committed to dotfiles.

